Even when Kiro generates the message, review it before committing.

### 14.2 PRs

Every PR generated with Kiro's help SHALL contain:

- Objective.
- Link or reference to the Spec.
- Technical summary.
- Changed files/modules.
- Executed tests.
- Risks and trade-offs.
- Screenshots/logs when applicable.
- Rollback instructions when needed.

Suggested PR template:

```markdown
## Objective

## Spec / context

## What changed

## How it was validated
- [ ] lint
- [ ] typecheck
- [ ] unit tests
- [ ] integration/e2e tests
- [ ] build

## Risks / trade-offs

## Rollback

## Notes for review
```

